Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:12.66,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Engage Visualization Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:24.92,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I found you...Sato and Jin!
