Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.68,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:41.88,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,D-Damn...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:46.85,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, he went away...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:48.86,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Y-Ya mean we're safe...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:53.49,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H140A00&\3c&H784A26&}Control Room {2:52}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.07,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,He-he-he...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.41,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Found me a couple of suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:06.17,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Reminds me of summer bugs \Nflying towards the light, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.67,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,It's game over for you two dimwits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.84,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wh-Who the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Don't expect him to answer that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.19,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,My name, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.30,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Or maybe not...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.07,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Messenger of the Netherworlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:20.68,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,Borinmaru Gokokuhotenji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:20.68,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(100,0)\bord0\c&HEDF4ED&\pos(320,214)}Borinmaru Gokokuhotenji {3:19}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:23.22,Default,Omi/Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wh-What a long name...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:27.48,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I bet you're scared \Noutta your wits, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:29.94,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Should we run for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:33.39,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's try to keep the peace and talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.80,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:40.05,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Umm... Go... Gokoku... Go? Gogoho?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:41.58,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Gokokuhojo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:43.33,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,That just means "plentiful \Nharvest" in Japanese!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.79,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You're way off, Omi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:48.12,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Gogo... Bori... Go... Go... Gobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.03,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Stop listing off Japanese vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.59,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We don't mean any harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.25,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.33,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Trust us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.46,Default,Kazuhiko+Omi,0,0,0,,Gobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:57.59,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,So you're both set on "Gobo"...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.35,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:07.23,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll make you both rust on my ruler...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:09.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Rust... on a ruler...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.86,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Do plastic rulers even rust?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.40,Default-Top,Omi,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.40,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\c&HEDF4ED&\pos(323,256)}Wow, dude
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.28,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hmph... Sure it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:19.41,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,With my Right that carves \Neverything in its path...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.86,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,The Zantetsu Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.28,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\c&HEDF4ED&\3c&H080C14&\frz8.792\pos(426,39)}Zantetsu Right {4:20}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.74,Default,Omi/Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Zantetsu Right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:28.03,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Which means you two suckers are \Nnew toys to take my frustrations out on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:31.05,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna die, swear \Nthat you'll become my servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:33.67,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll kill you here and now \Nif you refuse, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.65,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,O-O-Omi?! That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:38.60,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.09,0:04:42.05,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:45.88,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,What happened? I was gonna \Npersuade them but nothing came out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:49.42,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm a little nervous. Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.44,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll just go ahead and get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:53.42,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:54.86,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,...Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:56.19,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:57.88,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hey! You there, pea size!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.90,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You're being called a pea by a root veg!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.20,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Why aren't ya scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:04.37,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Cause there's no such thing \Nas a Zantetsu Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.20,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\bord0\c&HEDF4ED&\3c&H080C14&\pos(328,26)}Zantetsu Right {5:05}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.21,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Man, is he one of those know-it-alls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:14.68,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I-I dunno, are you sure about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:17.44,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,There could be one! \NMaybe you just don't know about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.77,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,There's no chance it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:19.80,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:24.93,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,How could a Right "carve everything"? \NThe name doesn't fit the ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:26.14,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:30.77,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Besides, Rights don't give explanations.\N There's no way to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:32.47,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,This is really bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.55,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but he's for {\i0}real{\i1} real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.02,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.91,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I was just showing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.31,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You sure are quick to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.91,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,But you sure seem to know a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:46.19,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Come on, spill the deets! For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:48.63,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Did you forget what you said \Nliterally five seconds ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Whaddaya think? Can we trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:57.09,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't trust anyone in this situation \Nafter just a few minutes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:03.93,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,Since he knows about Rights, he could\Nhave some kind of Right or Prime Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:06.68,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,We can talk to him a bit and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.64,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HD5D5D1&\c&H463934&}Control Room {6:06}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:12.23,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Oh... That's unfortunate, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:14.69,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Alright, now your turn, Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:16.59,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Don't settle on "Gobo"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:20.44,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm from class-2 at Itabashi Chuo\N Middle School! Borinmaru Gokokuhotenji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.15,Italics,Omi+Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,He didn't miss a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:26.78,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,My family and friends all died during \Nthe test run, and I was all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:32.54,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I was so sad and scared of dying that I shut \Nmyself in my house until Tasuketsu started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:36.88,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,But on Day One, I found myself headed \Nto the Designated Area of Suginami Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.50,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,But what I saw made me lose hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:42.59,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Something that couldn't possibly exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:46.09,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,It was a dragon, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:51.60,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I took off and ran for my life \Nwhen I found an envelope of Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:55.98,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,That's the only success I've had so far. \NOther than that, I've been cooped up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.44,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,A dragon... No doubt it's under \Nthe Production Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.48,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,Gotta be the baldie macho dude with Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.44,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good with machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:06.35,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,So I tweaked all the security \Ncameras in this area
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:08.78,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,and sent the footage to this Control Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.99,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I've been watching for \Npassersby every day since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:17.08,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I thought I could bluff some chumps \Ninto finding postboxes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:19.40,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You mean {\i1}we{\i0} were those chumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.39,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.82,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,So I sent off the weird guy \Nthat was chasing you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:26.30,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,and chose you two since \Nyou were closer to my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.30,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, that reminds me. \NWhy did Sensei run off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:31.81,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H23211F&\3c&HE9EAE6&\fad(200,1)\bord1.5\pos(85,110)}Right of\NPresentation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.81,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,The Right of Presentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.48,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I displayed a message in a show \Nwindow where he was running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.48,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\pos(315,50)}Warning {top row; 2:28}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.48,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(440,101,500,190)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.48,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(517,100,581,191)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.48,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(594,103,627,188)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.48,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(320,266)\clip(204,229,268,284)}Failure to comply for any reason \Nwill result in immediate execution. {2:28}
