Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.93,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\pos(539,121)}Those in pursuit of \Nother participants\Nwithin the Designated Area\Nmust disengage within\N10 seconds and move\Nto Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.93,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(539,304)}Failure to comply for any\Nreason will result in\Nimmediate execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.29,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Gave him orders to head to Nerima
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.94,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,or be executed immediately \Nwith the Emperor's emblem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:36.94,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\pos(315,50)}Warning {top row; 2:28}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:36.94,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(440,101,500,190)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:36.94,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(517,100,581,191)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:36.94,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\pos(513,190)\clip(594,103,627,188)}Those in pursuit of other \Nparticipants within the\NDesignated Area must\Ndisengage within 10 seconds\Nand move to Nerima Ward.
