Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.03,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That'll do the trick...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:48.99,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,Prime Rights: 12 left {top left first row; 7:43}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:48.99,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,Rights: 45 left {top left second row; 7:43}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:48.99,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,91)}40 years of age {center first row smaller text; 7:43}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:48.99,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,174)}Under or Over {center second row larger text; 7:43}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:48.99,Comp small -an9,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(403,294)}1,081,990 people left {bottom right; 7:43}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:46.72,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You've seen the Tasuketsu screen with the \Nremaining number of Rights and people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.99,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,That was all me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:51.06,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Seriously?! That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.52,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at sumthin' else...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.41,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:58.33,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Why are you two being \Nso honest about this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:02.70,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I-I never said I was telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:04.24,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Same here, I was just lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:04.74,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:05.42,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.71,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,Screw you, Antenna Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:10.45,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,I knew it, they're both idiots. \NAnd they're both telling the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.71,0:08:08.62,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,You want me to display your \Npersonal information across town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.62,0:08:11.50,Default-Top,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Why don't you get kicked in the ass \Nby Saneatsu, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:13.21,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,Too bad for you I'm from Itabashi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:13.21,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,He seems like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:15.58,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,where we have awesome defense \Nfrom the natural landscape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.96,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,And his Presentation Right \Nwill probably come in handy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.76,Default-Top,Gobo,0,0,0,,I hope your nails rot, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.40,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,If I could just introduce him to \NSaneatsu, he'd know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:20.40,Default-Top,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You literally make no sense, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.29,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,But the problem is how \Nto meet up with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:24.69,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Gobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.86,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Don't call me by that name, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.34,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Do you wanna help us defeat the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.49,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,L-Like I'd do something that scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:35.70,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,So what? You gonna stay here \Nforever until you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:39.14,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You guys are something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:42.25,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,With everyone dead, \NI barely feel alive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:45.96,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,And yet you're so calm. Talking 'bout \Ndefeating the Emperor and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.60,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:51.72,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I gave up, lashed out, and still \Nbarely function as normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:56.04,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We aren't so different. If it weren't \Nfor the Pres we'd still be in a panic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.21,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It was mostly luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:02.40,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I found myself in a group with some \Nbrave people that were willing to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.15,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That's how I feel, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:05.73,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I know I'm not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:12.32,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Having strong teammates makes me\N stronger, too. I can still laugh and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:15.41,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Sure, it may not matter \Nif we fight or hide in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.73,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It makes no difference \Nif we can't submit a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:21.42,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,99.9% of this comes down to luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:24.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,But there's zero chance if you give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:29.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Only those who try to survive \Ncan choose their own fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.63,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Isn't that what life's all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:34.72,Italics,Omi,0,0,0,,Sato-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:39.56,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That said, I'm not very smart, so I have \Nno clue if anything I say is right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:45.02,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,No, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:49.13,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Worst-case scenario, you die \Nwithout doing anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:51.95,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Best-case scenario, you live \Nby accomplishing something...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:55.16,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll bet my life on the best outcome, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.54,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,So? How do we meet up \Nwith your group, like, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:04.60,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We're supposed to meet up at the \NNorth Exit of Narimasu Station, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.51,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:08.29,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Let's see... Ummm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.78,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I'm not that smart, either, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:15.07,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Sato-kun, do you have any nicknames?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:16.72,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Sure, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:21.02,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Perfect. I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:23.01,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:41.75,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Narita-kun, should we wait \Nfor Sato-kun and Jin-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.59,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'll wait for them till morning, \Neven if it's by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:48.53,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This is the last time and place \Nwe agreed to meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:50.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,and we have no way of contacting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.86,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,If we can't meet up here, we might never...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.35,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,No way! It's not time yet, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.77,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No, it's still 23:55.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.27,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.19,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean. {first row; 11:04}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.19,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,186)}My seedy haul! {second row; 11:04}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:06.73,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.16,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,This is... a message of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:13.80,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Narita-kun, can you decode this by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.49,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi and Kazuhiko are safe...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:21.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What?! Where does it say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.37,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's pretty risky, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:26.87,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This way, no one else will \Nfully understand what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.22,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So it was Kazuhiko's idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:31.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Nah, he couldn't do this. \NIt was probably Omi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:32.96,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:35.33,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"Ippy-hiko" is Kazuhiko's nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:37.80,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Hey! I was the one that started that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:51.15,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:51.15,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,186)}My seedy haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.94,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord3\blur2\3c&H381DD2&\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)\clip(449.6,58.4,551.2,81.6)\fade(200,400)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:43.23,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"Ya mean" is Omi's phrase. \NAssuming it's a message to meet up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:46.42,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"Tomorrow" refers to the date, \Nand "A" is code for "AM".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:51.15,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord3\blur2\3c&H381DD2&\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)\fade(200,0)\clip(85,47,208.667,86)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:51.15,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord3\blur2\3c&H381DD2&\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)\fade(200,0)\clip(208.667,50,229.334,81)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:51.15,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord3\blur2\3c&H381DD2&\c&HE7FBF9&\pos(320,54)\fade(200,0)\clip(341,50,399,81)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:51.15,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"HBD" is about Kazuhiko's \Nbirthday, April 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:53.85,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,So why write "day" in English?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:57.86,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They probably want to \Nemphasize the date, the 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.70,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,But "28AM" makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:04.11,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Right, so add the two figures. \N"2" and "8" make...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:06.41,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Of course! 10 AM!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.41,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What about "My seedy haul"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:10.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Never mind! I got it after saying it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.17,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,City Hall of the Designated Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:14.42,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You understood all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.62,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This isn't too difficult to make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:19.54,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi must've made sure I could decode it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:23.04,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But the key word is "my". \NThis has to mean something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:24.39,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs48\bord0\blur1\c&HE7FBF9&\frz338.2\pos(428,105)\frx4\fry10}My seedy haul!{12:20}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:26.97,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,His own city hall? Like the nearest \None by the karaoke place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:30.15,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Nah, I think this is "mai" \Nmeaning "every" in Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.40,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,How does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:39.57,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\frx354\fry12\frz7.091\move(312,72,320,76,0,8150)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:39.57,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\frx354\fry12\frz7.091\move(295,183,300,167,0,8150)}My seedy haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:34.92,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Others might be able to decode "city hall"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:39.57,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They included a Plan B in case \Nsomething happens and we can't meet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:43.37,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I see. So every day at 10:00AM \Nstarting tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:46.12,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,They'll be at City Hall \Nin whatever Designated Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:47.91,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Not bad, Jin-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.79,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,But how were they able to \Ndisplay this screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:54.88,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,They must have gained a Right \Nor Prime Right to display messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.20,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.76,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\frx354\fry12\frz7.091\move(310,76,319,74)}Tomorrow A Ippy-hiko HBD day, ya mean. {first row; 12:57}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.76,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\bord0\c&HE7FBF9&\frx354\fry12\frz7.091\move(293,183,293,167,16,1976)}My seedy haul! {second row; 12:57}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.39,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,You must be relieved, Saneatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.52,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:12.59,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Cut it out with that face \Nbefore I break your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.20,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.49,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,We will...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:24.28,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,not be taking tally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:27.59,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Huh? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:30.69,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,A-Are we safe?! Is it over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:31.83,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:36.74,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow at 12:00AM, \NTasuketsu will move on to Stage Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Stage Two...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:42.01,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Some rules are subject to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:45.78,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Questions will only be \Naccepted through red laptops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:50.23,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Tallies will not take place \Nuntil a question is accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:54.60,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Laptops will have a remaining \Nbattery life of roughly one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:58.48,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,They may be charged, but please note that \NAC adapters are placed in a different location.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:03.95,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Laptops will be collected \Nevery day at 23:55PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:07.46,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Identify and enter passwords \Nlocated within Designated Areas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:10.33,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,to extend the collection \Ndeadline for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:15.10,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Doesn't this mean we're in for \Na fight over these laptops?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:16.85,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.23,0:14:20.18,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Laptops can be carried \Nbeyond Designated Areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.88,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,People will start coming out of hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:26.51,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,especially owners of \Nadvantageous Prime Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:28.17,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,But we gotta keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.77,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's do it, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:35.09,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,This stage transition...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:37.31,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Was it the plan all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:39.82,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Or was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:47.12,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Woah, who knew these postboxes \Nvanish into thin air!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:49.34,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Stage transition, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:51.86,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Not bad, considering they \Nonly had three minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:57.73,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,The Emperor sure is fickle, changing the rules \Nbecause of one measly submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:58.46,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:02.14,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,None of these halfwits stand \Na chance against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:05.13,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I'll burn down any filth that gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:12.71,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,This means war. I'll blow \Nthe entire human race to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:17.06,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\c&HDCD9D7&\3c&H6E6B67&\pos(276,92)\frx22\fry328\frz29.5\fade(500,0)}Kita Ward City Hall {15:16}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:21.40,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Omi! Kazuhiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:23.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Saneatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:26.24,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We did it! You really came!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:28.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Great job, Omi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.60,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,I'm glad you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.03,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Sup, Ippy-hiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:32.83,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Huh? What?! Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:36.29,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wait, weren't you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.57,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Dead? I thought so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.00,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I willed myself back to life, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:44.16,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That's awesome! Man, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:48.05,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"That's awesome"? He really is an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.05,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\c&H000503&\3c&H9A8886&\pos(534,99)}Seriously? {15:47}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.59,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:53.85,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Saaya and Eren Senpai are both safe. \NWe've met up with the Pres, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:55.73,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ya mean he really did come back ta life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.60,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yup! Along with Ryuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.43,Italics,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Back ta life...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:01.05,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Back ta life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:02.30,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Look at y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:05.36,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,You sure flock in a big group!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:09.24,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.41,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Wanna beat him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:11.72,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.37,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Hold up! He's with us, our team!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:18.52,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Our message last night and the remaining \Ncount on the Tasuketsu screen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:21.29,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,are all thanks to his Presentation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.46,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Oh, right... Great, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.38,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Hmph... Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.88,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,I'll enlighten you with my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:34.64,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Rahatzel Gokokuhotenji De La Mori Ogai \NMasamune El Borinmaru of the Darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:35.89,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,...Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.24,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,A.K.A. Gobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:38.28,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.56,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.98,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:47.69,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Saaya and Eren Senpai are on standby \Nsomewhere else so they wouldn't be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:48.88,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,In danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:53.32,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Your message. I'm guessing \Nothers have figured it out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:57.66,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The only information they wouldn't know \Nis Kazuhiko's birthday, so the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.08,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Which means the longer we're here, \Nthe more dangerous it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.96,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We'll meet up with the President first. \NHe's patrolling the area just outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.18,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:10.97,Italics,Gobo,0,0,0,,They're actually cool... for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:12.05,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\c&HDCD9D7&\3c&H6E6B67&\move(286,155,286,-70)\frx12\fry316\frz23.61}Kita Ward City Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.97,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We'll take a detour to meet with the Pres.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:18.31,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Let's think of a strategy \Nto find laptops after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:22.62,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Ryuta?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:27.36,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hey, don't run off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:30.28,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Thank God I finally found you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:33.24,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to talk, \Nso I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:35.87,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Let's all get along \Nlike the classmates we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:37.74,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.78,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The guy from the first day of the test run...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.45,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The second year who went \Nmissing the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.67,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I believed you'd all still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:50.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Good thing I came, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.12,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Um... Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:54.22,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hey! You remembered me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:56.22,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.64,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh, right... that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:03.73,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,How about I answer \Nif you tell me {\i1}your{\i0} motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:05.81,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Our motive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You haven't given up on Tasuketsu, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:13.49,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,We're defeating the Emperor \Nand putting an end to Tasuketsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.97,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy! But—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:19.97,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I guess we're the same, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:23.73,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You know, I lost everything that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:28.68,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So I said "screw it" and ran off, \Nbut... I couldn't do anything alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:31.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I've been trying to find my way \Nback to you guys ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.34,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So that's what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.39,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:40.49,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I have an eerie feeling, \Nlike something rotten's in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:44.06,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,My instincts are telling me \Nnot to trust this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:46.60,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Can I join you all in your fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone will be \Nhappy you're joining us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:52.28,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Welcome, Iruga Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.65,Flashback,Isshiki,0,0,0,,Mido and Ren Iruga. Those two are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:58.34,Flashback,Isshiki,0,0,0,,Someone has to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.38,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I recognize that look...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:03.62,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,How did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:08.76,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Jeez, calm down, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:13.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,How rude, trying to chop off my head \Nout of nowhere like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:16.09,Italics,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What the hell did he do?! \NWas that a Prime Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:18.72,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Come on, let's all be civil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:24.31,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,If I wanted to kill you, I would've done it \Nalready... like when we shook hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:26.02,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:30.11,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I just want the kid with the Rejection Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:32.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Omi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:35.03,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You guys are practically wasting his talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:36.58,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What do you want Omi for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.57,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,To defeat the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:42.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Go ahead and decline if you're not up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:44.66,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm the one who wants him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:47.04,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,It's Mido, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:48.94,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}do{\i0} know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:53.00,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's right! It's that creepy piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:58.26,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Wait, do you even know what Mido looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:02.36,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I guess that Isshiki lady \Ndidn't end up specifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:06.02,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,"End up"? What did you do to her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.23,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Huh? I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:12.29,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Why the long face? \NIs it bad that I killed someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:13.96,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,O-Of course it's ba—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.30,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Just what do you plan on doing \Nwhen you find the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:21.02,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna kill them? \NYou cold-blooded murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:25.99,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Submitting a question in Tasuketsu \Nis no different. It's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:29.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You're killing people based on \Nsome preconceived logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:35.09,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you believe in justice... \NI'd laugh my ass off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:36.52,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I haven't submitted anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:39.29,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But you're looking for \Nthose laptops, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You'll submit something \Nwhen you find one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:48.16,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,You said defeating the Emperor \Nwould be murder...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:50.31,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So the Emperor is human, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:55.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a person. Not that \NI know anything about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:59.15,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Huh... The Rejection Right kid \Nhasn't told you anything, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.70,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,What's this got to do with Omi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:06.45,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,My, my... You don't even know {\i1}that{\i0} part?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:10.83,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's cause we're from the same camp, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.70,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Camp...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.01,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,1)}Transition {21:17}
